# 统一换行：避免 Windows 同事 clone 下来后启动脚本变 CRLF 跑不起来
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.command text eol=lf

# 中文文件名在 Windows 上正常显示（core.quotepath 是客户端设置，这里只是表明文件是 UTF-8）
*.txt text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.md  text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.html text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.js  text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8

# 截图与压缩包按二进制处理，不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
